            "description": "<p>Gets the LOA-CFA for a connection, interconnect, or link aggregation group (LAG).</p> <p>The Letter of Authorization - Connecting Facility Assignment (LOA-CFA) is a document that is used when establishing your cross connect to Amazon Web Services at the colocation facility. For more information, see <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/directconnect/latest/UserGuide/Colocation.html\">Requesting Cross Connects at Direct Connect Locations</a> in the <i>Direct Connect User Guide</i>.</p>"
